<title>USA: Union Area School District, Pa., adjusted TIC.</title>
<headline>Union Area School District, Pa., adjusted TIC.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-03-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Union Area School District, Pa., said Monday it recalculated Boenning &amp; Scattergood, Inc's winning bid on the District's $6.560 million general obligation bond issue.</p>
<p>The District said the true interest cost was 5.3955 percent reflecting the cost of bond insurance, not the 5.35 percent originally calculated.</p>
</text>
